ion arrival transitions out of the corresponding MOVE state and stops the motor in the same scan; a station button cannot advance the next phase until a later scan.\",\n    \"Manual mode overrides automatic sequencing and resets phase to WAIT_A on every manual scan. Manual outputs follow button levels immediately.\",\n    \"Automatic transitions use the pre-scan phase and sampled inputs; accept at most one phase transition per scan. Station buttons are level-sensitive and accepted only in their corresponding wait state.\",\n    \"On return to automatic, start from WAIT_A; if SensorA and ButtonA are already true, their transition may occur in that scan.\",\n    \"The specified interface has no emergency-stop input or safety-rated functions. Provide appropriate independent safety circuitry and contactor interlocking in the physical installation.\"\n  ],\n  \"initial_values\": {\n    \"phase\": \"WAIT_A\",\n    \"MotorForward\": false,\n    \"MotorReverse\": false,\n    \"CompletionLight\": false,\n    \"timers\": \"None\",\n    \"edge_memory\": \"None required\"\n  },\n  \"scan_execution_order\": [\n    {\n      \"stage\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"Edge sampling\",\n      \"action\": \"Sample all input levels at invocation. No edge detection is required; do not edge-gate the level-sensitive buttons.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"stage\": 2,\n      \"name\": \"Safety/reset priority and state transitions\",\n      \"action\": \"If Mode is false, set phase to WAIT_A. Otherwise evaluate exactly one transition from the pre-scan phase using the sampled inputs. Arrival and completion-removal transitions take effect in this scan.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"stage\": 3,\n      \"name\": \"Unconditional top-level timer FB calls outside CASE/IF\",\n      \"action\": \"No timer FB calls are required. If timers are added later, call each once per scan unconditionally at top level.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"stage\": 4,\n      \"name\": \"Unified output assignments\",\n      \"action\": \"Assign outputs once using sampled inputs and the post-transition phase.\",\n      \"assignments\": {\n        \"MotorForward\": \"(NOT Mode AND ForwardButton AND NOT ReverseButton) OR (Mode AND (phase = MOVE_AB OR phase = MOVE_BC))\",\n        \"MotorReverse\": \"NOT Mode AND ReverseButton AND NOT ForwardButton\",\n        \"CompletionLight\": \"Mode AND phase = DONE\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"formal_assertions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A1\",\n      \"formula\": \"G(!(MotorForward & MotorReverse))\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A2\",\n      \"formula\": \"G(!Mode -> (MotorForward <-> (ForwardButton & !ReverseButton)))\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A3\",\n      \"formula\": \"G(!Mode -> (MotorReverse <-> (ReverseButton & !ForwardButton)))\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A4\",\n      \"formula\": \"G(Mode -> !MotorReverse)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A5\",\n      \"formula\": \"G(CompletionLight -> (Mode & SensorC & !MotorForward & !MotorReverse))\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
